.zed/

# Local-only private operational notes
docs/private/**
!docs/private/.gitkeep

# Local infrastructure readiness / migration notes (operational, never public)
docs/*runpod*readiness*.md
docs/*migration*readiness*.md
docs/**/*runpod*readiness*.md
docs/**/*migration*readiness*.md
docs/**/*runpod*private*.md
docs/**/*infra*private*.md

# Generated repo-tree / local structure snapshots (leak local paths)
docs/agent_bootstrap/repo_tree.txt
docs/agent_bootstrap/repo_tree_summary.md

# Project-memory review packets / local reports
reports/project_memory/**

